My heart was so [D]heavy in sin. I sank [A]low.
Then I heard about [D]Jesus. What a wonderful [G]hour.
I'm so glad that I [D]found out, He could bring [A]me out,
Through His saving [D]power.[G][D][A]

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Thank God I am [D]free, free, free, From [G]this world of [D]sin.
