{comment: Verse 2}
Like a bird out of [D]prison, That has taken its [G]flight.
Like a blind man that [D]God. Gave back his [A]sight.
Like a poor wretched [D]beggar, That found fortune and [G]fame
I'm so glad that I [D]found out, He could bring [A]me out,
